The company offers a comprehensive range of building materials, including lumber, doors, windows, roofing, siding, drywall, and flooring. They also provide custom millwork and design consultations at their showrooms. Cassity Jones is committed to expert service, fast deliveries, and competitive pricing, ensuring a positive experience for both employees and trade partners.","foundedYear":1950,"companyPhone":"+1 903-693-3834"},"headcount_label":"50-200","headcount_source":"apollo_enrichment","apollo_enriched_at":"2026-06-09T19:03:02.226Z","source_company_fields":{"sic_code":"5211","naics_code":"32412","company_city":"Longview","company_state":"Texas","company_country":"United States","company_phone_1":"903.759.3924","company_industry":"Building Materials","company_location":"302 Pine Tree Road, Longview, TX 75604, United States","company_post_code":"75604","company_state_abbr":"TX","company_description":"Cassity Jones Building Materials is a 65(+) year old family owned building materials supplier focused on helping professional builders succeed in building and improving the communities that we serve.  We have facilities in the Northeast Texas communities of Longview, Tyler, Henderson, Marshall and Terrell; We strive to be a company where the best builders in our market area want to trade and where the best employees in our industry want to work.
The Cassity Jones family of companies currently consists of 5 lumber and building material stores, 1 door fabrication operations, 1 floor covering operation, and a commercial flooring company. With corporate headquarters in Longview, these businesses operate throughout the Northeast Texas and Dallas area markets.","company_staff_count":"125","company_founded_date":"1950","company_name_cleaned":"Cassity Jones Building Materials","company_revenue_range":"$5M - $20M","company_annual_revenue":"17000000","company_li_profile_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/cassity-jones","company_website_domain":"cassityjones.com","company_country_alpha_2":"US","company_country_alpha_3":"USA","company_country_numeric":"840","company_staff_count_range":"51 - 200 employees"}}

